     <p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:150%">
</p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">4月11-12日，绍兴市直中学生田径运动会在越州中学燃情开赛</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，市直</span><span style="font-family:宋体">11所学校的千余名运动健儿展开激烈角逐</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">。我校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">学子奋勇拼搏，最终</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">斩获</span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2金9银11铜</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);font-size: 16px">、团体总分第三名</span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">的好成绩，郑祥霖老师获优秀教练员称号，</span><span style="font-family:宋体">屠健修同学获优秀运动员称号</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">跑道上疾驰冲刺，沙坑前腾跃而起，投掷区全力投掷</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">——</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">在为期两天的赛程中，一中健儿</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">始终以</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“永不言弃”的信念迎战每一场比赛，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">以汗水诠释体育精神，用拼搏谱写青春乐章。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><table width="422"><tbody><tr style="height:28px" class="firstRow"><td width="422" valig